<title>ARGENTINA: Banco Credito Argentino to issue $150 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Banco Credito Argentino to issue $150 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Credito Argentino SA said Tuesday it will issue $150 million in bonds due 2000 with a 9.5 percent coupon.</p>
<p>The bonds will be issued on April 24, the bank said in a statement to the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The lead manager is J.P. Morgan Securities Ltd.</p>
<p>This is the fifth bond issue under Credito's medium-term bond program approved in 1993.</p>
<p>((-- Axel Bugge, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668))</p>
